_🎯 Functional Correctness_ | _🟡 Minor_ | _⚡ Quick win_

**Include `.gschema.override` files in the compilation input.**

GLib reads these files to apply vendor defaults; omitting them silently changes bundled application settings. ([gnome.pages.gitlab.gnome.org](https://gnome.pages.gitlab.gnome.org/gtk/gio/class.Settings.html?utm_source=openai))

<details>
<summary>Proposed fix</summary>

```diff
-            if !name.ends_with(".gschema.xml") && !name.ends_with(".enums.xml") {
+            if !name.ends_with(".gschema.xml")
+                && !name.ends_with(".enums.xml")
+                && !name.ends_with(".gschema.override")
+            {
                 continue;
             }
```
